Z||000001||kslish||07-16-2001||11:48 PM||||I've been pondering replacing my beat-up stock 14" aluminum rims with those 16" Grand Am ones.  There are dozens of those rims in good shape available for cheap in the parts yards here in Western PA.  <P>There was a red coupe at the Michigan show which had those rims on it...first time I had seen them on a Fiero in person.  <P><P>------------------<BR>Ken S.<BR>'87GT and '86SC<BR>See them at <A HREF="http://homepage.mac.com/kjslish/Fiero.html" TARGET=_blank>http://homepage.mac.com/kjslish/Fiero.html</A><BR>Western PA Fiero Club - <A HREF="http://www.westpennfiero.org" TARGET=_blank>www.westpennfiero.org</A>||||reg||1
